title: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Modification / extension
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 2 of 5, type 'Modification / extension')
intro: A modification changes an authorization that is already approved, so step 2 checks whether the change alters what the plan requires: the authorization requirement, the benefit and the network. The patient's last check is shown beside the authorization. The request stays a request: nothing about the authorization changes until the payer approves it.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits' on Intake"
screen sc "Eligibility & Benefits · Modification / extension\n'Check whether the change alters what the plan requires.'"
screen sSum "Verification summary\nThe patient's last check\nAuthorization: Required, Concurrent review, Not required or Unknown\nExisting authorization with what is used and left"
decision dChg "What is the proposed change?"
process c1 "More days or units, or revised dates\nThe check should cover the new dates\n'This check covers other dates than the request asks for.'"
process c2 "A different service or level of care\nThe check is for another level of care, so it does not describe this case\nVerify makes a new one"
process c3 "A correction\nThe last check is shown as it is"
decision dAge "Is the check old, or for other dates?"
toast tOld "'This check covers other dates than the request asks for. Refresh it before you send.'"
click cRef "Click 'Refresh verification'"
agent aV "Verify asks the plan again, about 1.2 seconds"
decision dReq "What does the check say about the authorization?"
process q1 "Required or Concurrent review\nThe change goes to the payer as a request"
process q2 "Unknown\nWarning 'Authorization requirement unknown'\n'No rule on file says whether Summit requires an authorization for this service. Check with Summit. Nothing was assumed.'"
process q3 "Not required\n'No authorization required': go to the three actions"
goto gWarn "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Warnings and documented exceptions"
goto gNoAuth "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › No authorization required"
process pNote "The request is not an approval\nThe authorization keeps its approved dates and units until the payer decides"
group gFoot "Footer bar"
  click cBack "Click 'Back'"
  click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
  click cCont "Click 'Continue to Clinical documentation'"
endgroup
goto gDocs "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › Required and typical documents by type"

s1 --> sc --> sSum --> dChg
dChg -->|More days, more units, revised dates| c1
dChg -->|Different service| c2
dChg -->|A correction| c3
c1 --> dAge
c2 --> aV
c3 --> dReq
dAge -->|Yes| tOld --> cRef --> aV --> dReq
dAge -->|No| dReq
dReq -->|Required or concurrent| q1 --> pNote
dReq -->|Unknown| q2 --> gWarn
dReq -->|Not required| q3 --> gNoAuth
pNote --> cCont
sSum --> cBack
sSum --> cSave
cCont --> gDocs
